# Blockbuster: Underground - Local Tor Configuration Example
# Copy or append to torrc when running a local Tor daemon.

## Client & SOCKS5 Configuration
SOCKSPort 127.0.0.1:9050
ControlPort 127.0.0.1:9051
CookieAuthentication 1

## Circuit & Isolation Rules
EnforceDistinctSubnets 1
ClientOnly 1
SafeLogging 1

## Optional Onion Service Configuration (if hosting simulation relay)
# HiddenServiceDir /var/lib/tor/blockbuster_service/
# HiddenServicePort 80 127.0.0.1:8080
